  "label": "Humor derived from irony",
  "description": "The meme uses irony to create humor by juxtaposing the serious, disciplined nature of martial arts with the visual suggestion of incompleteness or half-heartedness. This requires understanding the concept of irony as a comedic device, where the literal meaning of the text contradicts the visual context to produce humor.",
